  "description": "Burdened with a debt of 180 million won due to his father’s business failure and his mother’s major surgery, Chang-Hyeon had been drifting from one job to another in the entertainment industry. Desperate to raise money, he turned to his high school classmate U A-Jun, a former rival and the illegitimate son of a chaebol family, as a last resort. \n\n*“Crawl over here. Onto the table.”*\n\nAt the moment of their reunion, A-Jun reveals his twisted true colors and demands that Chang-Hyeon become nothing more than a toy to warm his bed in exchange for the money. Suddenly reduced to a kept man, Chang-Hyeon finds himself trapped in a villa on “Nakdo,” a remote island in the middle of the ocean….\n\n(Source: MrBlue, translated)",
